                                "sense_id": "fb8591d2-4572-397c-9000-b04a6a12e593",
                                "text": "By decimation and a tythed death; / If thy Reuenges hunger for that Food, / Which Nature loathes, take thou the deſtin'd tenth, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                        "entry_id": "b8fcc97e-8c16-3071-b1e7-ff5e0ef51e9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The killing or destruction of any large portion of a population."
