                                "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                                "text": "And the vvhole Army had cauſe to enquire into their own Rebellions, vvhen they ſavv the Lord of Hoſts, vvith a dreadful Decimation, taking off ſo many of our Brethren by the vvorſt of Executioners."
                            },
