                                "sense_id": "205f80df-2a4a-3d83-ac7f-15b278dfa8bb",
                                "text": "General Secretary Mick Lynch said: \"It is crystal clear that the planned cutbacks on ScotRail and SWR are just the tip of the iceberg, as cynical employers use the cloak of COVID-19 to smuggle through the decimation of jobs and services on Britain's railways."
